<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns Aa1 rating to Hokkaido Electric.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns Aa1 rating to Hokkaido Electric.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Tuesday it had assigned a Aa1 rating to Hokkaido Electric Power Co Inc's 300 million marks of 5.0 percent bonds due to mature in 2001.</p>
<p>The rating is based on Hokkaido Electric Power's importance to the Japanese economy, its crucial role as a supplier within the Japanese utility industry and its very favourable industry operating environment, Moody's said in a statement.</p>
</text>
